  },
  "bio": [
   {
    "text": "A 2015 guide describes it as the inhospitable mountain range where the Temur have their clanholds.",
    "cites": [
     "p:stories/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In The Twins, it is the mountain range where the hunting party camps, and dragons melt the snow with fire and flood the valley.",
    "cites": [
     "p:stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13",
     "chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e6"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=People%20who%20wouldn%27t%20just,she%20was%20a%20shaman."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "The twins find the hunting party alive on a hill above the flood, and Baishya's whisper trance shows a vision of dragons waking from egg-stones, including the twins Nicol and Ugin.",
    "cites": [
     "chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e7",
     "chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e9",
     "chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e12"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Grandmother%20was%20tending%20to%20several%20injured%20people.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=By%20naming%20itself%20it,of%20its%20own%20destiny.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=You%27re%20Nicol%2C%20aren%27t%20you%3F%20That%27s%20your%20name."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Atarka's broodlings land at the camp demanding the clan surrender its shamans, and Yasova distracts them with goblin corpses.",
    "cites": [
     "chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e19",
     "chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e20"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=We%20smell%20magic%20in,will%20kill%20you%20all.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=For%20your%20trouble%2C%20and,little%20snack%20for%20you."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Baishya explains the vision came from Ugin and that they must go to his grave.",
    "cites": [
     "chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e21"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=That%27s%20why%20we%20have,go%20to%20Ugin%27s%20grave."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Later pages mention it as a range the party crossed before reaching the high plateau, one seen from the party's camp, and one where Atarka flies after her feast.",
    "cites": [
     "p:stories/chronicle-bolas-first-lesson-2018-06-20",
     "p:stories/chronicle-bolas-things-unseen-2018-06-27",
     "p:stories/chronicle-bolas-blood-and-fire-2018-07-18"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-first-lesson-2018-06-20",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-things-unseen-2018-06-27",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-blood-and-fire-2018-07-18"
    ]
   }
  ],
  "status": {
