   "order": 198,
   "story_date": "2018-06-13",
   "storyline": "Chronicle of Bolas",
   "source": "wizards",
   "paragraph": 80,
   "quote": "By naming itself it takes control of its own destiny.",
   "link": "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=By%20naming%20itself%20it,of%20its%20own%20destiny."
  },
  {
   "id": "chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e10",
   "summary": "Two large egg-stones crack into the ground without waking, and Palladia-Mors dismisses them as weak and goes hunting.",
