   "storyline": "Chronicle of Bolas",
   "source": "wizards",
   "paragraph": 125,
   "quote": "We must find the others first. Safety in numbers, as the hunters had.",
   "link": "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=We%20must%20find%20the,as%20the%20hunters%20had."
  },
  {
   "id": "chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e16",
   "summary": "Nicol rips off a dog's head and flies awkwardly to the peak with Ugin.",
   "participants": [
    "nicol-bolas",
